's stock market fell to the world's No. 7 position by market cap after a large sell-off. Chinese-owned yachts were barred from Taiwan's ports under revised rules announced by the Maritime and Port Bureau. Nvidia has launched an investigation into CEO Jensen Huang over an alleged affair with a Chinese spy, which a Taiwan think tank says is unlikely to majorly affect Taiwan's AI supply chain.\n- **Politics and elections:** Local elections are approaching, and a Taipei election primer and Taichung campaign coverage are circulating. Taiwan will hold a referendum alongside the nine-in-one local elections.\n- **Crime and security:** Taiwan sentenced two Chinese men over a New Taipei beach landing. Taiwan also accused China of election interference over sanctions on a firm linked to Puma Shen's father.\n\nSome items, such as the stock sell-off and the Papua New Guinea office closure, appear to be from earlier in the week or before, so check dates before treating them as today's news.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46aa49f9-25d5-4ddf-b813-32e07b17665d","uuid":"3a7804af-23b7-4389-bcd9-a48749c21c52","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:02:36.494Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Taiwan top news today November 10 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01QBeZ2cY5sZAKunQbSf9ESF","content":[{"title":"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News","url":"https://focustaiwan.tw/"},{"title":"Latest","url":"https://focustaiwan.tw/news"},{"title":"Taiwan news - breaking stories, video, analysis and opinion","url":"https://www.cnn.com/world/asia/taiwan"},{"title":"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World","url":"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan"},{"title":"Front Page - Taipei Times","url":"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News